WEBVTT

1
00:01:58.812 --> 00:02:00.178
♪ I'M GOING DOWN
TO SOUTH PARK ♪

2
00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:01.880
♪ GONNA HAVE MYSELF
A TIME ♪

3
00:02:01.882 --> 00:02:03.515
♪ FRIENDLY FACES
EVERYWHERE ♪

4
00:02:03.517 --> 00:02:05.316
♪ HUMBLE FOLKS
WITHOUT TEMPTATION ♪

5
00:02:05.318 --> 00:02:06.751
♪ GOING DOWN
TO SOUTH PARK ♪

6
00:02:06.753 --> 00:02:08.420
♪ GONNA LEAVE
MY WOE'S BEHIND ♪

7
00:02:08.422 --> 00:02:10.121
♪ AMPLE PARKING
DAY OR NIGHT ♪

8
00:02:10.123 --> 00:02:11.956
♪ PEOPLE SPOUTING
"HOWDY NEIGHBOR" ♪

9
00:02:11.958 --> 00:02:13.391
♪ HEADED ON
UP TO SOUTH PARK ♪

10
00:02:13.393 --> 00:02:15.427
♪ GONNA SEE IF
I CAN'T UNWIND ♪

11
00:02:15.429 --> 00:02:18.129
( mumbling )

12
00:02:18.131 --> 00:02:20.265
♪ SO COME ON DOWN
TO SOUTH PARK ♪

13
00:02:20.267 --> 00:02:22.367
♪ AND MEET SOME
FRIENDS OF MINE ♪

14
00:02:22.903 --> 00:02:24.035
HEY, WHERE'S
THE SCHOOL BUS?

15
00:02:24.037 --> 00:02:26.037
WE'RE GONNA BE LATE
FOR FOOTBALL PRACTICE.

16
00:02:26.039 --> 00:02:27.405
HIYA SPARKY.

17
00:02:27.407 --> 00:02:28.039
WHO'S THAT?

18
00:02:28.041 --> 00:02:29.240
THAT'S MY NEW
DOG SPARKY.

19
00:02:29.242 --> 00:02:30.775
HE FOLLOWED ME
TO THE BUS STOP.

20
00:02:30.777 --> 00:02:31.342
WOW, COOL!

21
00:02:31.344 --> 00:02:33.178
GOOD BOY SPARKY,
WHO'S MY BEST BUDDY?

22
00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:35.046
WHO'S MY BUDDY...
WHO'S MY BUDDY?

23
00:02:35.048 --> 00:02:37.115
YOU'RE MAKING ME
SICK, DUDE!

24
00:02:37.117 --> 00:02:38.817
HE'S PART DOBERMAN
AND PART WOLF.

25
00:02:38.819 --> 00:02:40.452
HE'S THE TOUGHEST DOG
ON THE MOUNTAIN.

26
00:02:40.454 --> 00:02:42.921
NO WAY, EVERYBODY
KNOWS THAT SYLVESTER

27
00:02:42.923 --> 00:02:45.256
IS THE TOUGHEST DOG
IN SOUTH PARK.

28
00:02:45.258 --> 00:02:47.225
GRRR!

29
00:02:47.227 --> 00:02:49.227
HE'S NOT MEANER
THAN SPARKY!

30
00:02:49.229 --> 00:02:50.962
OH YEAH,
LET'S SEE.

31
00:02:50.964 --> 00:02:51.963
HEY SYLVESTER!

32
00:02:51.965 --> 00:02:53.098
SPARKY WILL
KICK HIS ASS!

33
00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.166
I'LL PUT A DOLLAR
ON SYLVESTER.

34
00:02:55.168 --> 00:02:55.867
YOU'RE ON,
DUDE!

35
00:02:55.869 --> 00:02:59.037
THAT'S IT SPARKY,
KICK HIS ASS!

36
00:03:02.109 --> 00:03:04.676
HMM, HE'S DOING
<i>SOMETHING</i> TO HIS ASS.

37
00:03:04.678 --> 00:03:05.944
HE'S NOT KICKING
HIS ASS,

38
00:03:05.946 --> 00:03:08.646
BUT HE'S DEFINITELY DOING
SOMETHING TO HIS ASS.

39
00:03:08.648 --> 00:03:10.448
SPARKY, BAD DOG!

40
00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:11.916
( mumbling )

41
00:03:11.918 --> 00:03:12.450
WHAT?!

42
00:03:12.452 --> 00:03:14.352
DUDE, I THINK
YOUR DOG IS GAY.

43
00:03:14.354 --> 00:03:15.086
WHAT DO YOU MEAN?

44
00:03:15.088 --> 00:03:17.188
THAT DOG IS
A GAY, HOMOSEXUAL.

45
00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:19.891
HE'S JUST CONFUSED.

46
00:03:19.893 --> 00:03:20.959
I THINK
THE<i> OTHER</i> DOG'S

47
00:03:20.961 --> 00:03:22.260
THE ONE THAT'S
CONFUSED.

48
00:03:22.262 --> 00:03:23.094
( mumbling )

49
00:03:23.096 --> 00:03:24.462
SICK, SHUT UP DUDE!

50
00:03:24.464 --> 00:03:27.398
STAN'S DOG'S
A HOMO!

51
00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:29.667
STAN'S DOG'S A HOMO!

52
00:03:30.537 --> 00:03:31.336
( chef )
OKAY CHILDREN,

53
00:03:31.338 --> 00:03:33.905
I KNOW YOU'RE ALL EXTREMELY
EXCITED AND NERVOUS

54
00:03:33.907 --> 00:03:36.241
AND ANXIOUS ABOUT
THE HOMECOMING GAME

55
00:03:36.243 --> 00:03:37.809
AGAINST MIDDLE PARK.

56
00:03:37.811 --> 00:03:38.543
WHO'S MIDDLE PARK?

57
00:03:38.545 --> 00:03:39.277
WHAT'S
HOMECOMING?

58
00:03:39.279 --> 00:03:40.945
BUT JUST REMEMBER
WHAT I TAUGHT YOU--

59
00:03:40.947 --> 00:03:43.014
THAT FOOTBALL
IS LIKE MAKING LOVE

60
00:03:43.016 --> 00:03:45.650
TO A REALLY
BEAUTIFUL WOMAN.

61
00:03:45.652 --> 00:03:48.419
YOU CAN'T ALWAYS SCORE,
BUT WHEN YOU DO,

62
00:03:48.421 --> 00:03:50.688
IT MAKES ALL THE TRY
WORTHWHILE.

63
00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:54.225
NOW LET'S
START PRACTICE.

64
00:03:54.728 --> 00:03:55.693
MR. CHEF, SIR?

65
00:03:55.695 --> 00:03:56.895
YES PIP,
WHAT IS IT?

66
00:03:56.897 --> 00:03:58.796
I STILL DON'T
HAVE A HELMET.

67
00:03:58.798 --> 00:03:59.364
I KNOW PIP,

68
00:03:59.366 --> 00:04:01.166
THE SCHOOL CAN'T AFFORD
HELMETS FOR EVERYBODY.

69
00:04:01.168 --> 00:04:03.067
YES, BUT COULDN'T
WE ROTATE?

70
00:04:03.069 --> 00:04:04.569
WHO DOESN'T HAVE
A HELMET EVERY WEEK?

71
00:04:04.571 --> 00:04:06.037
DOES IT ALWAYS
HAVE TO BE ME?

72
00:04:06.039 --> 00:04:08.606
YES PIP,
I'M AFRAID IT DOES.

73
00:04:08.608 --> 00:04:09.641
OH.

74
00:04:09.643 --> 00:04:10.441
SORRY SON.

75
00:04:10.443 --> 00:04:11.876
NOW GET YOUR ASS
IN THERE!

76
00:04:11.878 --> 00:04:14.212
HUT, HUT, HUT, HUT, HUT.

77
00:04:14.214 --> 00:04:17.515
HUT, HUT, HUT,
HUT, HUT, HUT...

78
00:04:17.517 --> 00:04:19.551
HIKE THE DAMN BALL!

79
00:04:21.454 --> 00:04:21.953
AHH!

80
00:04:21.955 --> 00:04:24.255
HEY, HOW'S PRACTICE
COMING THERE CHEF?

81
00:04:24.257 --> 00:04:26.124
HUH... OH,
FINE, FINE.

82
00:04:26.126 --> 00:04:27.325
I DON'T HAVE TO
REMIND YOU

83
00:04:27.327 --> 00:04:29.027
JUST HOW IMPORTANT
THIS GAME IS

84
00:04:29.029 --> 00:04:30.528
TO US SOUTH PARK ALUMNI.

85
00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:31.763
<i>ELEMENTARY</i> SCHOOL
ALUMNI?

86
00:04:31.765 --> 00:04:33.765
THAT'S AS FAR AS
MOST OF US GOT.

87
00:04:33.767 --> 00:04:34.699
YOU THINK
WE HAVE A SHOT

88
00:04:34.701 --> 00:04:37.202
AT BEATING THE SPREAD
AGAINST MIDDLE PARK
THIS YEAR?

89
00:04:37.204 --> 00:04:39.470
I DON'T KNOW,
WHAT'S THE SPREAD?

90
00:04:39.472 --> 00:04:41.773
MIDDLE PARK
BY 70 POINTS.

91
00:04:41.775 --> 00:04:42.774
HMM...

92
00:04:42.776 --> 00:04:45.376
I GOT IT!
I GOT IT!

93
00:04:45.378 --> 00:04:46.678
I DON'T THINK
WE HAVE A CHANCE.

94
00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.714
NONSENSE, NOT WITH
MY NEPHEW A QUARTERBACK.

95
00:04:49.716 --> 00:04:51.115
RIGHT STANLEY?

96
00:04:51.117 --> 00:04:53.117
HUH?

97
00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:57.422
THAT-A-BOY!

98
00:04:57.424 --> 00:04:58.923
GREAT PASS,
STAN!

99
00:04:58.925 --> 00:04:59.457
COME ON NED,

100
00:04:59.459 --> 00:05:01.659
WE GOT TO GET OUR
ASSES TO THE BOOKIE!

101
00:05:02.862 --> 00:05:05.063
OKAY, THAT WAS
GOOD PRACTICE CHILDREN.

102
00:05:05.065 --> 00:05:07.599
WE'LL SEE YOU HERE
AGAIN TOMORROW.

103
00:05:07.601 --> 00:05:08.733
HEY STAN, ISN'T
THAT YOUR DOG?

104
00:05:08.735 --> 00:05:11.803
YEAH, HE MUST HAVE FOLLOWED
ME TO FOOTBALL PRACTICE.

105
00:05:11.805 --> 00:05:13.438
YOU SEE,
HE IS SMART.

106
00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:14.906
UH, MY DOG REX
FOLLOWS ME

107
00:05:14.908 --> 00:05:16.541
TO FOOTBALL PRACTICE
ALL THE TIME.

108
00:05:16.543 --> 00:05:19.444
YEAH, BUT MY DOG FOUND
HIS OWN WAY HERE.

109
00:05:19.446 --> 00:05:21.145
THAT MAKES
HIM SMARTER.

110
00:05:21.147 --> 00:05:22.380
SPARKY, GET DOWN!

111
00:05:22.382 --> 00:05:24.716
OH MY GOD, WHAT IS
HE DOING TO MY DOG?

112
00:05:24.718 --> 00:05:26.017
THERE HE GOES AGAIN!

113
00:05:26.019 --> 00:05:27.585
GET DOWN
SPARKY, DOWN!!

114
00:05:27.587 --> 00:05:28.820
STAN FORGOT
TO MENTION THAT

115
00:05:28.822 --> 00:05:30.888
HIS DOG IS A GAY,
HOMOSEXUAL.

116
00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.457
MAKE HIM STOP!

117
00:05:32.459 --> 00:05:34.659
( yelping )

118
00:05:34.661 --> 00:05:36.828
I'M SURE GLAD
MY DOG ISN'T GAY!

119
00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:40.932
MAYBE YOU SHOULD
NAME YOUR DOG SPARKETTE!

120
00:05:44.504 --> 00:05:45.270
AND SO YOU SEE,

121
00:05:45.272 --> 00:05:48.273
"SIMON AND SIMON" WERE
NOT BROTHERS IN REAL LIFE,

122
00:05:48.275 --> 00:05:49.440
ONLY ON TELEVISION.

123
00:05:49.442 --> 00:05:52.143
THANK YOU FOR THAT
PRESENTATION ERIC.

124
00:05:52.145 --> 00:05:55.079
BUT THE ASSIGNMENT
WAS ON ASIAN CULTURES,

125
00:05:55.081 --> 00:05:56.481
YOU GET A D-.

126
00:05:56.483 --> 00:05:57.415
DAMMIT!

127
00:05:57.417 --> 00:05:59.651
WHO SHOULD WE CALL
ON NEXT, MR. HAT?

128
00:05:59.653 --> 00:06:00.585
HOW ABOUT STAN,

129
00:06:00.587 --> 00:06:03.054
OUR LITTLE SOUTH PARK
QUARTERBACK STAR?

130
00:06:03.056 --> 00:06:03.955
GOOD IDEA.

131
00:06:03.957 --> 00:06:05.790
OKAY STANLEY,
YOU'RE NEXT.

132
00:06:05.792 --> 00:06:07.492
I'M NOT REALLY
PREPARED EITHER.

133
00:06:07.494 --> 00:06:09.994
JUST MAKE SOMETHING UP
LIKE ERIC DID.

134
00:06:09.996 --> 00:06:11.596
OKAY, UMM,

135
00:06:11.598 --> 00:06:12.830
ASIAN CULTURE HAS,

136
00:06:12.832 --> 00:06:14.666
PLAGUED OUR FRAGILE
EARTH FOR MANY YEARS.

137
00:06:14.668 --> 00:06:16.034
WE MUST END IT.

138
00:06:16.036 --> 00:06:17.568
EXCELLENT, A-!

139
00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:18.036
HEY!

140
00:06:18.038 --> 00:06:19.003
WOW, COOL!

141
00:06:19.005 --> 00:06:19.637
WAIT A MINUTE,

142
00:06:19.639 --> 00:06:21.105
WHY THE HELL DOES
HE GET AN A-?!

143
00:06:21.107 --> 00:06:24.042
ERIC, STANLEY JUST MIGHT
LEAD OUR TEAM TO VICTORY

144
00:06:24.044 --> 00:06:25.476
AGAINST THE
MIDDLE PARK COWBOYS

145
00:06:25.478 --> 00:06:27.145
FOR THE FIRST TIME
IN DECADES!!

146
00:06:27.147 --> 00:06:28.813
AND WE TREAT
STAR ATHLETES BETTER

147
00:06:28.815 --> 00:06:30.682
BECAUSE THEY'RE
BETTER PEOPLE.

148
00:06:30.684 --> 00:06:31.449
THAT'S NOT FAIR!

149
00:06:31.451 --> 00:06:34.152
LIFE ISN'T FAIR KIDDO,
GET USED TO IT.

150
00:06:34.154 --> 00:06:35.386
STUPID PUPPET!

151
00:06:35.388 --> 00:06:37.188
DON'T FORGET YOUR
ASSIGNMENTS TONIGHT,

152
00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:39.524
THEY'RE DUE TOMORROW
FOR EVERYBODY BUT STAN.

153
00:06:39.526 --> 00:06:41.492
MR. GARRISON, CAN I
ASK YOU A QUESTION?

154
00:06:41.494 --> 00:06:43.428
OF COURSE STANLEY,
WHAT IS IT?

155
00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:45.563
WHAT'S A
HOMOSEXUAL?

156
00:06:45.565 --> 00:06:47.231
OH WELL STANLEY,

157
00:06:47.233 --> 00:06:49.233
I GUESS YOU CAME
TO THE RIGHT PERSON.

158
00:06:49.235 --> 00:06:50.535
SIT DOWN.

159
00:06:50.537 --> 00:06:53.604
STANLEY,
GAY PEOPLE...

160
00:06:53.606 --> 00:06:55.973
WELL, GAY PEOPLE
ARE EVIL.

161
00:06:55.975 --> 00:06:58.810
EVIL RIGHT DOWN TO
THEIR COLD BLACK HEARTS,

162
00:06:58.812 --> 00:07:01.079
WHICH PUMP, NOT BLOOD
LIKE YOURS AND MINE,

163
00:07:01.081 --> 00:07:03.014
BUT RATHER
A THICK VOMITUS OIL

164
00:07:03.016 --> 00:07:04.649
THAT OOZES THROUGH
THEIR ROTTEN VEINS,

165
00:07:04.651 --> 00:07:06.250
AND CLOTS IN THEIR
PEA-SIZED BRAINS,

166
00:07:06.252 --> 00:07:08.953
WHICH BECOMES THE CAUSE
OF THEIR NAZI-ESQUE PATTERNS

167
00:07:08.955 --> 00:07:10.455
OF VIOLENT BEHAVIOR.

168
00:07:10.457 --> 00:07:11.956
DO YOU UNDERSTAND?

169
00:07:11.958 --> 00:07:12.423
I GUESS.

170
00:07:12.425 --> 00:07:14.959
GOOD, I'M GLAD WE COULD HAVE
THIS LITTLE TALK STANLEY.

171
00:07:14.961 --> 00:07:16.828
NOW YOU GO OUTSIDE AND
PRACTICE FOOTBALL

172
00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:19.197
LIKE A GOOD
LITTLE HETEROSEXUAL.

173
00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:23.167
( Cartman )
YOU GUYS SEE ME BLOCK
THAT DEFENSE TODAY?

174
00:07:23.169 --> 00:07:24.135
I WAS KICKING ASS.

175
00:07:24.137 --> 00:07:26.237
YOU'RE GONNA NEED TO
KICK MORE ASS THAN THAT

176
00:07:26.239 --> 00:07:27.305
TO BEAT THE COWBOYS.

177
00:07:27.307 --> 00:07:29.474
HEY, SPEAKING OF
POUNDING ASS,

178
00:07:29.476 --> 00:07:31.442
HERE COMES STAN'S
LITTLE HOMO DOG!

179
00:07:31.444 --> 00:07:32.276
SHUT UP DUDE!

180
00:07:32.278 --> 00:07:35.246
SPARKY, WHERE'D YOU
GET THAT PINK SCARF?

181
00:07:35.248 --> 00:07:35.847
WOOF, WOOF.

182
00:07:35.849 --> 00:07:38.182
THAT IS THE GAYEST
DOG I HAVE EVER SEEN.

183
00:07:38.184 --> 00:07:40.284
HE JUST NEEDS SOME
TRAINING, THAT'S ALL.

184
00:07:40.286 --> 00:07:41.819
SIT SPARKY.

185
00:07:41.821 --> 00:07:44.222
GOD BOY,
NOW SHAKE.

186
00:07:44.224 --> 00:07:47.392
GOOD BOY, NOW,

187
00:07:47.394 --> 00:07:48.593
DON'T BE GAY!

188
00:07:48.595 --> 00:07:50.962
DON'T BE GAY
SPARK.

189
00:07:50.964 --> 00:07:52.797
DON'T BE GAY.

190
00:07:52.799 --> 00:07:53.998
DID IT WORK?

191
00:07:53.1000 --> 00:07:54.632
I DON'T KNOW.

192
00:07:54.634 --> 00:07:56.634
HE STILL LOOKS
PRETTY GAY TO ME.

193
00:07:56.636 --> 00:07:57.201
HEY STAN,

194
00:07:57.203 --> 00:07:59.937
YOUR DOG BEEN TO ANY
ANY PRIDE MARCHES LATELY?

195
00:07:59.939 --> 00:08:01.906
YEAH, MAYBE YOU
SHOULD TAKE HIM TO

196
00:08:01.908 --> 00:08:04.709
A<i> BARBRA STREISAND</i> CONCERT!

197
00:08:04.711 --> 00:08:07.145
STUPID GAY DOG.

198
00:08:07.147 --> 00:08:09.580
COME ON YOU GUYS,
I HAVE AN IDEA.

199
00:08:14.621 --> 00:08:17.822
I WANT $500 ON
THE SOUTH PARK COWS.

200
00:08:17.824 --> 00:08:18.723
ARE YOU CRAZY?

201
00:08:18.725 --> 00:08:21.392
NO SIREE,
I'M TELLING YOU,
I GOT THE LINE.

202
00:08:21.394 --> 00:08:23.795
MY NEPHEW STAN IS
THE BEST QUARTERBACK

203
00:08:23.797 --> 00:08:25.062
THE SCHOOL'S
EVER SEEN.

204
00:08:25.064 --> 00:08:27.965
I GUARANTEE THEY'LL
BEAT THE SPREAD.

205
00:08:27.967 --> 00:08:30.301
( man )
I'M GONNA PUT ALL
MY MONEY ON THE COWS.

206
00:08:30.303 --> 00:08:33.671
I'LL PUT $300
ON THE COWS TOO...

207
00:08:33.673 --> 00:08:35.640
( chatter )

208
00:08:36.276 --> 00:08:37.475
WHOA, WHOA.

209
00:08:37.477 --> 00:08:39.043
DON'T GET TOO
CARRIED AWAY NOW.

210
00:08:39.045 --> 00:08:41.779
YOU BETTER BE RIGHT
ABOUT THIS JIMBO.

211
00:08:41.781 --> 00:08:44.549
DON'T WORRY YOURSELF.

212
00:08:44.551 --> 00:08:47.185
ARE YOU SURE STAN
IS THAT GOOD?

213
00:08:47.187 --> 00:08:48.719
NOT THAT SURE.

214
00:08:48.721 --> 00:08:51.789
I THINK WE BETTER COME UP
WITH A BACK-UP PLAN.

215
00:08:51.791 --> 00:08:53.858
LET'S SEE HERE.

216
00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:54.459
HEY BOOKIE,

217
00:08:54.461 --> 00:08:56.527
WHAT'S THE HALF-TIME
SHOW GONNA BE?

218
00:08:56.529 --> 00:08:57.328
YOU HAVEN'T HEARD?

219
00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:59.831
<i>JOHN STAMOS'</i> OLDER
BROTHER RICHARD STAMOS

220
00:08:59.833 --> 00:09:01.799
IS GONNA SING
"LOVING YOU".

221
00:09:01.801 --> 00:09:03.100
I LOVE THAT SONG.

222
00:09:03.102 --> 00:09:05.470
"LOVING YOU",
THAT'S PERFECT.

223
00:09:05.472 --> 00:09:06.237
COME ON NED,

224
00:09:06.239 --> 00:09:08.439
MIDDLE PARK IS GONNA
GET A HALF-TIME SHOW

225
00:09:08.441 --> 00:09:10.475
THEY'LL NEVER FORGET.

226
00:09:13.346 --> 00:09:14.579
NOW WHY DON'T...

227
00:09:14.581 --> 00:09:15.213
DAMMIT SPARKY,

228
00:09:15.215 --> 00:09:16.681
WHERE DO YOU KEEP
GETTING THIS THING?

229
00:09:16.683 --> 00:09:18.649
NO PINK BANDANA
SPARKY, BAD DOG!

230
00:09:18.651 --> 00:09:19.750
NOW PAY
ATTENTION--

231
00:09:19.752 --> 00:09:23.421
SPARKY THIS IS
FIFI, OOH LA-LA!

232
00:09:23.423 --> 00:09:24.555
THERE HE GOES.

233
00:09:24.557 --> 00:09:26.757
THAT-A-BOY SPARK,
GET HER!

234
00:09:26.759 --> 00:09:29.060
YES!

235
00:09:31.764 --> 00:09:33.798
AH CRAP, NOW
WHAT DO I DO?

236
00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:35.199
WHO CARES IF
YOUR DOG IS GAY.

237
00:09:35.201 --> 00:09:36.467
MAYBE IT'S
NOT THAT BAD.

238
