LET'S GO HOME.

479
00:17:39.418 --> 00:17:41.051
I CAN STILL MAKE IT
IN TIME FOR THE GAME.

480
00:17:41.053 --> 00:17:43.020
WE CAN WORK ON
MAKING YOU NOT GAY

481
00:17:43.022 --> 00:17:44.955
TOGETHER.

482
00:17:45.458 --> 00:17:46.490
SPARKY?

483
00:17:46.492 --> 00:17:47.091
YOUNG MAN,

484
00:17:47.093 --> 00:17:48.859
IT APPEARS YOU STILL
DON'T UNDERSTAND.

485
00:17:48.861 --> 00:17:50.461
WHAT DON'T I
UNDERSTAND?

486
00:17:50.463 --> 00:17:51.462
COME THIS WAY.

487
00:17:51.464 --> 00:17:52.496
I HAVE TO SHOW
YOU SOMETHING.

488
00:17:52.498 --> 00:17:54.231
JUST OVER A MINUTE TO GO
IN THE HALF.

489
00:17:54.233 --> 00:17:56.900
THE SCORE IS
MIDDLE PARK COWBOYS 52,

490
00:17:56.902 --> 00:17:59.636
SOUTH PARK COWS ZERO.

491
00:18:02.141 --> 00:18:04.608
I HAVEN'T SEEN AN ENGLISHMAN
TAKE A BLOW LIKE THAT

492
00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:05.876
SINCE<i> HUGH GRANT</i>!

493
00:18:05.878 --> 00:18:08.112
DUDE, NOW THAT
IS NOT COOL.

494
00:18:08.114 --> 00:18:09.113
SORRY, SORRY.

495
00:18:09.115 --> 00:18:10.848
OKAY STAN, YOU
SHOULD GET IN LINE

496
00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:13.317
FOR MY MY BIG
GAY BOAT RIDE.

497
00:18:13.753 --> 00:18:16.420
STEP ABOARD
STANLEY.

498
00:18:18.090 --> 00:18:18.756
HELLO EVERYONE,

499
00:18:18.758 --> 00:18:20.991
AND WELCOME ABOARD
THE BIG GAY BOAT RIDE!

500
00:18:20.993 --> 00:18:21.658
ON THIS ADVENTURE,

501
00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.260
WE'LL BE SEEING
THE WORLD OF GAYNESS

502
00:18:23.262 --> 00:18:24.361
THROUGHOUT TIME.

503
00:18:24.363 --> 00:18:26.930
AND THE SOUTH PARK COWS
ARE SET TO RECEIVE,

504
00:18:26.932 --> 00:18:27.898
THERE'S THE KICK.

505
00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:30.534
IT'S TAKEN BY NUMBER 23,
KENNY McCORMICK.

506
00:18:30.536 --> 00:18:33.971
HE'S AT THE 50,
THE 40, THE 30...

507
00:18:33.973 --> 00:18:37.474
THE LITTLE RUNNING BACK
IS DOWN!

508
00:18:37.476 --> 00:18:38.642
I THINK HE'S...

509
00:18:38.644 --> 00:18:41.378
YES, HE'S BEEN
DECAPITATED!

510
00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:44.982
OH MY GOD,
THEY KILLED KENNY!

511
00:18:44.984 --> 00:18:46.450
YOU BASTARDS!

512
00:18:46.452 --> 00:18:48.685
THAT'S GOTTA
HURT FRANK!

513
00:18:48.687 --> 00:18:49.353
OUCHEROO!

514
00:18:49.355 --> 00:18:51.922
HEY, COME ON,
THAT WAS "ROUGHING"!!

515
00:18:51.924 --> 00:18:54.658
AT LEAST LET US
SCRAPE HIM OFF THE FIELD!

516
00:18:54.660 --> 00:18:56.160
LOOKS LIKE THE
SOUTH PARK COWS

517
00:18:56.162 --> 00:18:58.695
AREN'T EVEN GONNA BEAT
THE 72 POINT SPREAD,

518
00:18:58.697 --> 00:19:00.464
NOT BY A LONG SHOT.

519
00:19:00.466 --> 00:19:01.065
YOU SEE,

520
00:19:01.067 --> 00:19:03.534
GAYNESS HAS EXISTED SINCE
THE BEGINNING OF TIME.

521
00:19:03.536 --> 00:19:05.569
FROM THE EGYPTIAN PHARAOHS,

522
00:19:05.571 --> 00:19:07.671
TO THE SHOGUNS
OF JAPAN.

523
00:19:07.673 --> 00:19:10.707
UH-OH, LOOK OUT,
IT'S THE OPPRESSORS!

524
00:19:10.709 --> 00:19:14.244
CHRISTIANS AND REPUBLICANS
AND NAZIS, OH MY!

525
00:19:14.246 --> 00:19:14.945
( gunshot )

526
00:19:14.947 --> 00:19:17.147
OH, GOSH,
THAT WAS CLOSE.

527
00:19:17.149 --> 00:19:18.982
OKAY, LET'S STEER
OUR BIG GAY BOAT
OUT OF HERE,

528
00:19:18.984 --> 00:19:22.686
AND INTO A PLACE WHERE GAYS
ARE ALLOWED TO LIVE FREELY.

529
00:19:23.989 --> 00:19:26.156
♪ WE ARE GAY,
AND IT'S OKAY ♪

530
00:19:26.158 --> 00:19:29.226
♪ 'CAUSE GAY MEANS HAPPY
AND HAPPY MEANS GAY ♪

531
00:19:29.228 --> 00:19:30.394
♪ WE'RE NOT SAD
ANYMORE ♪

532
00:19:30.396 --> 00:19:31.862
♪ 'CAUSE WE'RE OUT
THE CLOSET DOOR ♪

533
00:19:31.864 --> 00:19:35.032
♪ IT'S OKAY, HEY,
TO BE GAY ♪♪

534
00:19:35.034 --> 00:19:36.834
SO, WHAT DO YOU
THINK STAN?

535
00:19:36.836 --> 00:19:37.801
THIS KICKS ASS.

536
00:19:37.803 --> 00:19:39.770
I'M SORRY I TRIED
TO CHANGE YOU, SPARK.

537
00:19:39.772 --> 00:19:41.138
I JUST DIDN'T
UNDERSTAND.

538
00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:42.739
ISN'T THIS PRECIOUS?

539
00:19:42.741 --> 00:19:45.142
AND NOW HERE TO SING
THE TOUCHING SONG

540
00:19:45.144 --> 00:19:45.909
"LOVING YOU",

541
00:19:45.911 --> 00:19:49.680
IS THE ONE AND ONLY,
JOHN STAMOS' BROTHER!

542
00:19:49.682 --> 00:19:51.448
ALRIGHT RICHARD!

543
00:19:52.885 --> 00:19:55.018
♪ LOVING YOU ♪

544
00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:59.389
♪ IS EASY
'CAUSE YOU'RE BEAUTIFUL ♪

545
00:19:59.391 --> 00:20:02.593
♪ DOOT-EN-DOOT-DOOT-DOO ♪

546
00:20:02.595 --> 00:20:06.396
♪ AH... AH... ♪

547
00:20:06.398 --> 00:20:07.231
WHAT THE HELL?

548
00:20:07.233 --> 00:20:08.665
HE DIDN'T SING
THE HIGH "F"!

549
00:20:08.667 --> 00:20:10.801
RICHARD STAMOS CAN'T
SING A HIGH "F",

550
00:20:10.803 --> 00:20:12.669
HE ALWAYS SCREWS
IT UP LIKE THIS.

551
00:20:12.671 --> 00:20:15.372
NED, WE ARE GONNA
GET OUR ASSES KICKED!

552
00:20:15.374 --> 00:20:16.607
♪ LA, LA, LA,
LA, LA ♪

553
00:20:16.609 --> 00:20:18.475
IT'S OBVIOUS WHERE
ALL THE TALENT

554
00:20:18.477 --> 00:20:21.778
IN THAT FAMILY WENT!

555
00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:23.981
THANKS FOR
<i>EVERYTHING</i>
BIG GAY AL.

556
00:20:23.983 --> 00:20:24.748
WOOF!

557
00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:25.549
NO PROBLEM KIDS.

558
00:20:25.551 --> 00:20:26.950
ARE YOU SURE YOU DON'T
WANT TO STAY FOR

559
00:20:26.952 --> 00:20:28.685
SOME TOASTED
CHEESE SANDWICHES?

560
00:20:28.687 --> 00:20:29.253
NO THANKS,

561
00:20:29.255 --> 00:20:31.121
I GOTTA GET BACK FOR
THE BIG FOOTBALL GAME.

562
00:20:31.123 --> 00:20:32.256
COME ON BOY.

563
00:20:32.258 --> 00:20:33.323
OH STAN...

564
00:20:33.325 --> 00:20:34.825
WHEN YOU GET
BACK TO TOWN,

565
00:20:34.827 --> 00:20:36.760
TELL THEM ABOUT US
WILL YOU?

566
00:20:36.762 --> 00:20:39.429
TELL THEM THERE ARE
GAY ANIMALS HERE,

567
00:20:39.431 --> 00:20:42.065
WHO NEED HOMES,
DESPERATELY.

568
00:20:42.067 --> 00:20:43.500
I WILL BIG GAY AL,

569
00:20:43.502 --> 00:20:45.402
I WILL.

570
00:20:46.038 --> 00:20:48.639
OH, MY CARROT CAKE.

571
00:20:48.641 --> 00:20:51.141
THESE SOUTH PARK COWS
ARE BEING ABSOLUTELY

572
00:20:51.143 --> 00:20:52.242
MOLESTED BY MIDDLE PARK.

573
00:20:52.244 --> 00:20:54.211
I HAVEN'T SEEN SO MANY
CHILDREN MOLESTED SINCE...

574
00:20:54.213 --> 00:20:55.979
I THOUGHT YOU SAID
BEATING THE SPREAD

575
00:20:55.981 --> 00:20:57.181
WAS A SURE THING,
JIMBO!

576
00:20:57.183 --> 00:21:00.651
( Mr. Hat )
YEAH, WE ALL PUT OUR
LIFE SAVING IN THIS GAME!

577
00:21:00.653 --> 00:21:02.386
YOU'RE A DEAD
MAN JIMBO!

578
00:21:02.388 --> 00:21:04.621
THIS SHOULD JUST ABOUT
WRAP IT UP...

579
00:21:04.623 --> 00:21:06.790
WAIT A MINUTE,
WHAT'S THIS?

580
00:21:06.792 --> 00:21:07.925
YEAH, YAHOO!

581
00:21:07.927 --> 00:21:10.761
IT'S STAN, THE SOUTH PARK
STAR QUARTERBACK.

582
00:21:10.763 --> 00:21:12.596
WHERE THE HELL
HAVE YOU BEEN STAN?

583
00:21:12.598 --> 00:21:14.698
I'VE BEEN GETTING
MY BEST FRIEND BACK.

584
00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:16.066
JUST GET
IN THERE BOY.

585
00:21:16.068 --> 00:21:18.202
GIVE THEM HELL
STANLEY!

586
00:21:18.871 --> 00:21:21.071
JESUS, NOW I HAVEN'T
ASKED YOU FOR MUCH.

587
00:21:21.073 --> 00:21:23.273
ALL WE NEED IS
ONE LITTLE SCORE.

588
00:21:23.275 --> 00:21:25.909
PLEASE,
PLEASE JESUS.

589
00:21:25.911 --> 00:21:27.511
LEAVE ME ALONE!

590
00:21:27.513 --> 00:21:28.512
STAN HIKES THE BALL,

591
00:21:28.514 --> 00:21:29.713
HE STEPS BACK
TO PASS.

592
00:21:29.715 --> 00:21:31.648
HEY STAN,
I'M OPEN I THINK.

593
00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:34.985
AND HE THROWS IT TO KYLE,
THE LITTLE JEWISH KID.

594
00:21:36.455 --> 00:21:37.454
OH MY!

595
00:21:37.456 --> 00:21:39.256
I HAVEN'T SEEN A JEW
RUN LIKE THAT

596
00:21:39.258 --> 00:21:41.091
SINCE POLAND, 1938!

597
00:21:41.093 --> 00:21:42.593
DUDE!

598
00:21:43.429 --> 00:21:44.861
TOUCHDOWN.

599
00:21:44.863 --> 00:21:45.929
YEAH.

600
00:21:45.931 --> 00:21:47.531
THE CLOCK RUNS OUT
AND THE FINAL SCORE IS

601
00:21:47.533 --> 00:21:51.235
MIDDLE PARK COWBOYS 73,
SOUTH PARK COWS 6.

602
00:21:51.237 --> 00:21:54.104
SOUTH PARK
BEATS THE SPREAD.

603
00:21:54.106 --> 00:21:57.040
YEAH!

604
00:21:57.042 --> 00:21:57.841
SPEECH.

605
00:21:57.843 --> 00:21:59.509
STAN, WHAT DO YOU WANT
TO TELL THE WORLD

606
00:21:59.511 --> 00:22:02.079
ABOUT THIS STUNNING,
ALMOST VICTORY?

607
00:22:02.081 --> 00:22:03.747
IT'S REALLY COOL

608
00:22:03.749 --> 00:22:06.316
THAT WE BEAT THE SPREAD
AGAINST THE COWBOYS.

609
00:22:06.318 --> 00:22:07.351
YEAH, RIGHT!

610
00:22:07.353 --> 00:22:10.053
AND MAYBE WE CAN BEAT 'EM
EVEN MORE NEXT YEAR.

611
00:22:10.055 --> 00:22:14.057
AND IT'S OKAY
TO BE GAY.

612
00:22:14.059 --> 00:22:15.826
( silence )

613
00:22:15.828 --> 00:22:16.326
WHAT?

614
00:22:16.328 --> 00:22:18.295
BEING GAY IS JUST
PART OF NATURE,

615
00:22:18.297 --> 00:22:19.363
AND A BEAUTIFUL THING.

616
00:22:19.365 --> 00:22:21.231
WHAT THE HELL IS
HE TALKING ABOUT?

617
00:22:21.233 --> 00:22:23.767
STANLEY YOU ARRIVED
VERY LATE IN THE GAME.

618
00:22:23.769 --> 00:22:25.302
WHERE WERE YOU
THAT WHOLE TIME?

619
00:22:25.304 --> 00:22:27.537
I WAS WITH MY NEW
FRIEND, BIG GAY AL.

620
00:22:27.539 --> 00:22:29.373
HE SHOWED ME HIS BIG GAY
ANIMAL SANCTUARY

621
00:22:29.375 --> 00:22:30.907
AND TOOK ME ON
A BIG GAY BOAT RIDE,

622
00:22:30.909 --> 00:22:34.144
WHERE I LEARNED ALL ABOUT
THE WONDERS OF GAIETY.

623
00:22:35.281 --> 00:22:37.581
IT'S TRUE,
I'LL SHOW YOU.

624
00:22:39.718 --> 00:22:41.952
BUT IT WAS HERE,
IT WAS ALL RIGHT HERE.

625
00:22:41.954 --> 00:22:44.087
THERE WAS A TECHNO
DANCE CLUB.

626
00:22:44.089 --> 00:22:46.356
YOU NEED TO LAY OFF
THE COUGH SYRUP.

627
00:22:46.358 --> 00:22:47.491
ALRIGHT?
SERIOUSLY.

628
00:22:47.493 --> 00:22:49.092
I'M WORRIED
ABOUT YOU MAN.

629
00:22:49.094 --> 00:22:50.060
OLIVER!

630
00:22:50.062 --> 00:22:51.628
I THOUGHT YOU
RAN AWAY

631
00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:53.463
ALL THOSE MONTHS AGO.

632
00:22:53.465 --> 00:22:54.698
SIDNEY!

633
00:22:54.700 --> 00:22:55.432
WILLIE!

634
00:22:55.434 --> 00:22:56.333
CARLOS!

635
00:22:56.335 --> 00:22:57.868
I WANT TO
THANK YOU SO MUCH

636
00:22:57.870 --> 00:22:59.469
FOR BRINGING
EVERYBODY HERE.

637
00:22:59.471 --> 00:23:00.971
OH, THERE
YOU ARE DUDE.

638
00:23:00.973 --> 00:23:01.872
HOW'S IT GOING?

639
00:23:01.874 --> 00:23:03.740
I'M SUPER,
THANKS FOR ASKING.

640
00:23:03.742 --> 00:23:07.311
IT LOOKS LIKE NOW
MY WORK HERE IS DONE.

641
00:23:08.314 --> 00:23:11.148
GOODBYE STANLEY,
PEACE BE WITH YOU.

642
00:23:11.150 --> 00:23:12.949
WOW!

643
00:23:15.287 --> 00:23:17.454
YOU GUYS, YOU GUYS,
I CAN DO IT.

644
00:23:17.456 --> 00:23:18.322
DO WHAT?

645
00:23:18.324 --> 00:23:19.756
♪ LOVING YOU ♪

646
00:23:19.758 --> 00:23:22.659
♪ IS EASY 'CAUSE
YOU'RE BEAUTIFUL ♪

647
00:23:22.661 --> 00:23:25.095
♪ DOOT-EN-DOOT-DOOT-DOO ♪

648
00:23:25.097 --> 00:23:26.830
♪ AHH ♪

